Clean-room UI policy
--------------------
The UI components in src/components are NOT derived from Tailwind UI / Catalyst,
which is a separately licensed commercial product. Contributors must not copy
markup or class compositions from Tailwind UI into this repository. Using the
open-source Tailwind CSS framework itself is fine.

Keeping the dependency surface minimal is also a security choice — see
SECURITY.md.
